cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or documentation, please cite it as below."
title: "Future Disclosure: Astronomy & Alien Planets"
abstract: >-
  An open science and education project describing fifteen testable places where
  new discoveries about planets, moons, small bodies and interstellar objects may
  be waiting in public astronomy data, with evidence levels, lessons for all ages,
  and a tested Python package (fdastro) for orbit fitting, bound-orbit tests,
  Tisserand screening, astrometry, transit, exomoon, obliquity and microlensing
  calculations.
authors:
  - name: "Future Disclosure contributors"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/utahisnotastate/ufwwaragainstearthsstars"
url: "https://github.com/utahisnotastate/ufwwaragainstearthsstars"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
